{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/6axv26","slideIndex":0,"text":"This is the planned real-time experiment. The design crosses three cube sizes, three initial hand–object distances and three grasp durations, with one trial per combination. Distance and duration are target values. Calculate trial-level metrics on the frames valid for all three models. Summarize the nine trials per size and all 27 trials using mean and standard deviation."}